---

## 3. `.gitignore` (Exclusions) 🚫

```gitignore
# Python artifacts
__pycache__
*.pyc
*.pyo

# IDE/OS specific files
.DS_Store
.idea
.vscode

# Jupyter Notebook checkpoints
.ipynb_checkpoints

# Data and Logs
submission.json
yolo_dataset/

# Model Weights and Training Logs (Crucial for ML projects)
# Ignore the entire runs folder, but allow the single best model weight.
/runs/
!/runs/detect/train/weights/best.pt 

# Temporary files
*.tmp